# COMAC AgentOS — Force .bat / .cmd to be treated as BINARY
# Why: .gitattributes text=eol=crlf normalizes CRLF to LF on commit,
# which breaks CMD.exe on deploy targets. Treating as binary means:
#   - git add  : preserves verbatim (no \r stripping)
#   - commit   : stores exactly what's in the working tree
#   - checkout : no auto-conversion, deploy target gets CRLF as we wrote it
# The trade-off is that git diff shows the whole file on every change
# (no line-level diff for .bat), but that's acceptable for our use case.
*.bat    binary
*.cmd    binary

# Everything else: let git auto-detect (LF for .py / .md / .json is fine)
